an><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}=\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}^{\\mathcal C^{op}}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}=\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}^{\\mathcal C^{op}}\\)</span> 为预层拓扑斯；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega(C)\">\\(\\Omega(C)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上筛的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a> 的 Grothendieck 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PullSieve}(f,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{PullSieve}(f,S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的 LT 条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 内解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 在本条由对象映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_0\">\\(\\Omega_0\\)</span> 与箭头映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_1\">\\(\\Omega_1\\)</span> 内建；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\Rightarrow\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\Rightarrow\\Omega\\)</span> 的候选自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(J)\">\\(\\Phi(J)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a> 取有源靶的三元组，而非仅取分量族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:D\\to C\">\\(g:D\\to C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(J)_C\">\\(\\Phi(J)_C\\)</span> 是其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 分量的有类型集合映射。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 的分类子在本条选为下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,t_\\Omega)\">\\((\\Omega,t_\\Omega)\\)</span>；LT 谓词所用的真值交是它由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a> 确定的典范交运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\">\\(1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\)</span> 为下列单元素预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\">\\(*\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> 的别名。</p>\n<p>各对象公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 定义，各箭头公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_{J,C}\">\\(\\phi_{J,C}\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega(C)\">\\(\\Omega(C)\\)</span>。候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Omega_0(C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_1(g)\\coloneqq(\\Omega_0(C),\\Omega_0(D),(S\\mapsto\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S))),\\qquad\\Omega\\coloneqq(\\Omega_0,\\Omega_1),\\\\\n1_0(C)\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad1_1(g)\\coloneqq(\\{\\varnothing\\},\\{\\varnothing\\},(*\\mapsto*)),\\qquad1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\coloneqq(1_0,1_1),\\\\\nt_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\left(1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}},\\Omega,((\\{\\varnothing\\},\\Omega(C),(*\\mapsto\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C))))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(\\Omega,t_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\phi_{J,C}(S)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\in J(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\},\\\\\n\\Phi(J)\\coloneqq(\\Omega,\\Omega,((\\Omega(C),\\Omega(C),\\phi_{J,C}))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\Psi(j)\\coloneqq\\left(C\\mapsto\\{S\\in\\Omega(C)\\mid j_C(S)=\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\Omega_0(C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_1(g)\\coloneqq(\\Omega_0(C),\\Omega_0(D),(S\\mapsto\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S))),\\qquad\\Omega\\coloneqq(\\Omega_0,\\Omega_1),\\\\\n1_0(C)\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad1_1(g)\\coloneqq(\\{\\varnothing\\},\\{\\varnothing\\},(*\\mapsto*)),\\qquad1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\coloneqq(1_0,1_1),\\\\\nt_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\left(1^{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}},\\Omega,((\\{\\varnothing\\},\\Omega(C),(*\\mapsto\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C))))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(\\Omega,t_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\phi_{J,C}(S)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\in J(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\},\\\\\n\\Phi(J)\\coloneqq(\\Omega,\\Omega,((\\Omega(C),\\Omega(C),\\phi_{J,C}))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\Psi(j)\\coloneqq\\left(C\\mapsto\\{S\\in\\Omega(C)\\mid j_C(S)=\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(\\Phi(J))\\land\\Psi(\\Phi(J))=J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(\\Phi(J))\\land\\Psi(\\Phi(J))=J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(\\Psi(j),\\mathcal C)\\land\\Phi(\\Psi(j))=j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(\\Psi(j),\\mathcal C)\\land\\Phi(\\Psi(j))=j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.4 Theorem 1，印刷页 233–234；DjVu 第 122–123 图页。预层分类子的构造见 I.4，印刷页 37–39；DjVu 第 24–25 图页。对子预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq F\">\\(B\\subseteq F\\)</span>，其特征映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 处将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{u:D\\to C\\mid F(u)(x)\\in B(D)\\}\">\\(\\{u:D\\to C\\mid F(u)(x)\\in B(D)\\}\\)</span>；子预层封闭性给出筛，自然性来自前合成，包含恒等箭头当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in B(C)\">\\(x\\in B(C)\\)</span>，因此给所写分类子普遍性质及唯一性。筛拉回的复合恒等式给出 Φ 的自然性；覆盖的局部性给出幂等，交稳定给出有限交保持。反方向以 j(S) 为极大筛定义覆盖；自然性与幂等证明局部性。两种构造互逆由 f∈j_C(S) 当且仅当 j_D(f* S) 为极大筛。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothend